id: pm-review-finding-lineage
title: Keep one disposition across provider finding observations
description: "Preserve review-specific finding identity across providers and revisions, with explicit confirmation, retained observations and one canonical disposition. Core duplicate detection and pm-jev remain candidate proposers."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-22T19:22:39.664Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T19:50:22.409Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Near matches remain proposals until confirmed; Source withdrawal does not erase prior reasoning; Duplicate imports add no second disposition; Typed SDK and CLI provide compact TOON and JSON with actionable typed refusals; Works without git and validates a read-only public tracker copy
parent: pm-review-epic
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T19:23:23.079Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked against installed core SDK 2026.10.18 and current CLI registry 2026.10.22, pm-jev dedupe.ts and index.ts, and pm-review import/verdict/coverage/round code. Core duplicates and scoreItemSimilarity rank lexical candidates; pm-jev dedupe proposes or explicitly links duplicate/related work. Neither preserves review-specific cross-provider observations and a canonical review disposition. Reuse complete SDK reads, similarity scoring, lock-scoped idempotent comments and the existing item mutation/history pipeline. Preserve original imported decisions as historical observations; compute one canonical disposition for confirmed groups. Local checks are targeted; CI npm and Bun release gates provide the complete evidence."
  "2026-10-22T19:32:32.670Z",codex-agent,"Public real-data validation completed read-only against an origin/main tracker export in a plain directory with git discovery fenced off: 48 total items, 22 review observations, 3 providers, 2 known source revisions, 22 independent canonical dispositions, 4 core candidate clusters, 3 review pair proposals checked and all 3 left unconfirmed. All 102 original durable files remained byte-identical. Largest compact JSON lineage receipt: 894 bytes. Details and repeatable validator: docs/finding-lineage-validation.md and test/lineage-public-tracker.ts."
  "2026-10-22T19:40:24.186Z",codex-agent,"Correction to the initial overlap note: this branch pins and installs PM SDK 2026.10.19; the canonical checkout inspected first had 2026.10.18. The registry CLI version was verified as 2026.10.22. The checked SDK capabilities and overlap conclusions are unchanged. Three isolated behavioral reverts all exit 1 with named assertion failures: confirmation disabled breaks canonical identity; withdrawal marking disabled breaks the withdrawn flag; canonical verdict routing reverted breaks shared fix/commit projection. The original package source is unchanged by these scratch-copy reverts. Local strict health reports a global pm-github version-skew finding and one pre-existing stale item advisory; CI uses a fresh runner to verify the tracked project. A local directory package-install fixture hit the SDK 10000-entry scan refusal; the fixture now installs only release contents. No upstream issues were filed."
  "2026-10-22T19:50:18.106Z",codex-agent,"Implementation and public validation are complete. PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/pull/29 (ready for review). Live CLI 2026.10.22 duplicates help also confirms core cluster discovery; sibling pm-jev supplies candidates without review-specific identity. PM-linked local checks passed 3/3: node --test test/lineage.test.ts (6/6), npm run typecheck, npm run lint. The final import-receipt refinement also passed its targeted repeat-import/withdrawal test; receipts now expose canonical ids, effective verdicts and newly withdrawn counts. A fourth isolated behavioral revert of receipt projection fails the canonical-id assertion. First full CI at commit 5e85ead passed Node 22 npm, Node 26 npm and Bun: 182/182 tests and 1/1 packed acceptance per gate, 29 measured source files at 100/100/100/100, zero duplication. Run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/actions/runs/39842585284 . The PR retains the final-head gate receipt for the receipt refinement. Automatic reviewer availability is incomplete (CodeRabbit automatic review disabled; Sourcery budget unavailable); no approval is claimed. Proposal hashes bind snapshots rather than reserving both items. No merge or release performed; item remains in progress for orchestrator verification."
